<title>SOUTH AFRICA: PERSETEL ISSUES FURTHER CAUTIONARY.</title>
<headline>PERSETEL ISSUES FURTHER CAUTIONARY.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-12-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Persetel Holdings Ltd announced on Monday that, further to an announcement on November 8, the company had entered into an agreement to acquire an information technology company abroad.</p>
<p>In terms of the agreement, certain operational approvals were required before further details of the acquisition could be published.</p>
<p>Further details of the acquisition, which would be subject to the approval of Persetel shareholders, would be published around January 13.</p>
<p>Until then, shareholders were advised to continue exercising caution in their sharedealings.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom, +27 11 482-1003</p>
</text>
